            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "San Francisco: 7-card stud variant where all Queens are wild. Same deal and betting as 7-card stud; any Queen counts as any card. USA; dealer's choice.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "American 7-card stud variant; Queens wild. Popular in home and dealer's choice games.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'From two to eight players may take part. The game is best for five to seven players; with eight players the deck can run short on the final deal. All four Queens are wild for every player.',
